WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.947
Dictionaries are mutable, so a record can change over time.

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:07.977
Projects begins at two and is updated to three.

00:00:07.977 --> 00:00:12.367
Department is a completely new key, so assignment adds it.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:16.125
Pop removes role and returns the removed value.

00:00:16.609 --> 00:00:23.261
This mirrors many real data workflows: a record arrives, fields are corrected or enriched,

00:00:23.261 --> 00:00:26.066
and outdated fields may be removed.

00:00:26.066 --> 00:00:30.091
Run the example and watch the record change step by step.
